# Terms of the System Reference Document 5.1 (English, CC-BY-4.0, see the tab license), by hand;
# page numbers of SRD_CC_v5.1.pdf. Variant name: the term written out.

# Damage types: p. 97 ("Damage Types"); the phrase as after the dice in stat blocks, e.g.
# p. 218 "7 (1d8 + 3) slashing damage plus 4 (1d8) necrotic damage"
Rules/Damage/acid: acid
Rules/Damage/acid/Phrase: acid damage
Rules/Damage/bludgeoning: bludgeoning
Rules/Damage/bludgeoning/Phrase: bludgeoning damage
Rules/Damage/cold: cold
Rules/Damage/cold/Phrase: cold damage
Rules/Damage/fire: fire
Rules/Damage/fire/Phrase: fire damage
Rules/Damage/force: force
Rules/Damage/force/Phrase: force damage
Rules/Damage/lightning: lightning
Rules/Damage/lightning/Phrase: lightning damage
Rules/Damage/necrotic: necrotic
Rules/Damage/necrotic/Phrase: necrotic damage
Rules/Damage/piercing: piercing
Rules/Damage/piercing/Phrase: piercing damage
Rules/Damage/poison: poison
Rules/Damage/poison/Phrase: poison damage
Rules/Damage/psychic: psychic
Rules/Damage/psychic/Phrase: psychic damage
Rules/Damage/radiant: radiant
Rules/Damage/radiant/Phrase: radiant damage
Rules/Damage/slashing: slashing
Rules/Damage/slashing/Phrase: slashing damage
Rules/Damage/thunder: thunder
Rules/Damage/thunder/Phrase: thunder damage

# Abilities: stat block p. 218 "STR DEX CON INT WIS CHA"; names p. 76 ("Ability Scores and Modifiers");
# save: short for "<Ability> saving throw", e.g. p. 10 "a Wisdom saving throw"
Rules/Term/str: STR
Rules/Term/str/name: Strength
Rules/Term/str/save: STR save
Rules/Term/dex: DEX
Rules/Term/dex/name: Dexterity
Rules/Term/dex/save: DEX save
Rules/Term/con: CON
Rules/Term/con/name: Constitution
Rules/Term/con/save: CON save
Rules/Term/int: INT
Rules/Term/int/name: Intelligence
Rules/Term/int/save: INT save
Rules/Term/wis: WIS
Rules/Term/wis/name: Wisdom
Rules/Term/wis/save: WIS save
Rules/Term/cha: CHA
Rules/Term/cha/name: Charisma
Rules/Term/cha/save: CHA save

# Terms: AC p. 62 "Armor Class (AC)"; HP p. 116 table "Size HP AC" (= de p. 149);
# DC p. 77 "Difficulty Class ... DC"; CR p. 15 "Destroy Undead (CR 1/2)" (= de p. 30);
# XP p. 258 "experience points (XP)"; GM p. 12 "before the GM says" (= de p. 12), "the game master" p. 59.
# The SRD 5.1 says GM, not DM (182 times GM, never DM). Proficiency bonus: p. 8 class table
# "Level Proficiency Bonus" (91 times written out); the SRD 5.1 never abbreviates it, PB is the
# abbreviation in use (to be checked in the review of all terms).
Rules/Term/ac: AC
Rules/Term/ac/name: Armor Class
Rules/Term/hp: HP
Rules/Term/hp/name: hit points
Rules/Term/dc: DC
Rules/Term/dc/name: Difficulty Class
Rules/Term/cr: CR
Rules/Term/cr/name: challenge rating
Rules/Term/xp: XP
Rules/Term/xp/name: experience points
Rules/Term/gm: GM
Rules/Term/gm/name: game master
Rules/Term/pb: PB
Rules/Term/pb/name: proficiency bonus
